<main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
  <div class="space-y-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8">
        scFAIR metadata schema
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700">
        The metadata schema defines how dataset metadata should be structured and annotated so submissions are consistent, interoperable, and reusable across tools and studies.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">
        The scFAIR metadata schema is inspired by the CELLxGENE metadata schema fork from
        <%= link_to "single-cell-curation schema 7.1.0", "https://github.com/chanzuckerberg/single-cell-curation/tree/main/schema/7.1.0", class: "text-red-500 hover:text-red-600 text-sm", target: "_blank" %>.
        The scFAIR metadata schema is available at
        <%= link_to "scFAIR metadata schema documentation (README for schema version 7.1.0)", "https://github.com/scFAIR/scFAIR/blob/main/schema/7.1.0/README.md", class: "text-red-500 hover:text-red-600", target: "_blank" %>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
